{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23427","headline":"六年寒食洛下宴游赠冯李二少尹 · 白居易","name":"六年寒食洛下宴游赠冯李二少尹","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"丰年寒食节，美景洛阳城。\n三尹皆强健，七日尽晴明。\n东郊蹋青草，南园攀紫荆。\n风拆海榴艳，露坠木兰英。\n假开春未老，宴合日屡倾。\n珠翠混花影，管弦藏水声。\n佳会不易得，良辰亦难幷。\n听吟歌暂辍，看舞杯徐行。\n米价贱如土，酒味浓於饧。\n此时不尽醉，但恐负平生。\n殷勤二曹长，各捧一银觥。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_23427.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23427","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}